{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-130","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-talk-403816600-line","text":"你站在观众席的外围，整张脸都因拥挤趴在防护窗上，真空中的飞船皆蓄势以待，为了在待会儿看清它们的轨迹，在十光年内的陨石圈都布满了传感器。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-talk-403816601-line","text":"「智人们智械们，还有头上长满菠萝花的智能植物们，欢迎来到银河星船竞速赛的现场！让我感受到你们的振动好不好？」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-talk-403816602-line","text":"随着险些炸烂观众席的爆破迸发，一道道飞光自黑暗的背景中划过。观众们竞相押下筹码，以期选手为他们带来暴富的结局。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-text-9554410058842498730-choice","text":"押最快的那艘。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-text-13174767034945651755-effect","text":"光粒子冲压式发动机，你值得拥有。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-text-17771023151299076137-choice","text":"押最稳的那艘。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-text-6226671658824027249-effect","text":"亚光速飞船，别忘了安装时间稳定仪。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-text-17415739668754676474-choice","text":"押最慢的那艘。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-130-text-7049708351628354341-effect","text":"寿司飞船，真空何必考虑流线型。","speaker":""}]}
